+## SDV contract and evidence review
+
+Before running checks, list the requirement or contract clause, literal expected
+result, command, and evidence needed for each claim. Include the isolation or
+rejection case when a shared vehicle boundary is involved. Preserve any prior
+failure and attach the later result to the exact revision and configuration.
+
+After each check, record the observed result and exit status. Identify the
+boundary actually exercised (synthetic/replay, HTTP substitute, real component,
+or joined live). For each requirement, record any missing check or pending
+owner decision. A command exit, technical outcome and owner approval are
+three separate facts. Preserve exact-revision evidence and rerun affected checks
+when their inputs change.
+
